### TITLE ###
RadColor_Complex
### INPUT ###
url = "https://google.com"
name = json[].name
city = json[].city
rad url:
	fields name, city
	name:
		color "red" "o[a-z]"
	city:
		color "blue" "o[a-z]"
		color "yellow" "ndon"
		color "red" "ndo"
### ARGS ###
--mock-response
.*:./responses/people.json
--color=always
### STDOUT ###
\"\x1b[33mname   \x1b[0m  \x1b[33mcity       \x1b[0m "
\"Charlie  Paris        "
\"B\x1b[31mob\x1b[0m      L\x1b[34mo\x1b[0m\x1b[31mndo\x1b[0m\x1b[33mn\x1b[0m       "
\"Alice    New Y\x1b[34mor\x1b[0mk     "
\"B\x1b[31mob\x1b[0m      L\x1b[34mos\x1b[0m Angeles  "
### STDERR ###
Mocking response for url (matched ".*"): https://google.com

### TITLE ###
RadColor_Plain
### INPUT ###
url = "https://google.com"
name = json[].name
city = json[].city
rad url:
	fields name, city
	city:
		color "red" "London"
		color "plain" "ndo"
### ARGS ###
--mock-response
.*:./responses/people.json
--color=always
### STDOUT ###
\"\x1b[33mname   \x1b[0m  \x1b[33mcity       \x1b[0m "
\"Charlie  Paris        "
\"Bob      \x1b[31mLo\x1b[0mndo\x1b[31mn\x1b[0m       "
\"Alice    New York     "
\"Bob      Los Angeles  "
### STDERR ###
Mocking response for url (matched ".*"): https://google.com

### TITLE ###
RadColorErrorsOnInvalidColor
### INPUT ###
url = "https://google.com"
name = json[].name
color = "licorice"
rad url:
    fields name
    name:
        color color "o[a-z]"
### STDERR ###
error[RAD20025]: Invalid color value "licorice". Allowed: [black blue bold cyan dim green italic
  magenta orange pink plain red strikethrough underline white yellow]
  --> <script>:7:15
  |
6 |     name:
7 |         color color "o[a-z]"
  |               ^^^^^
  |
  = info: rad docs RAD20025
### EXIT ###
1

### TITLE ###
RadColorRejectsStyleAttrInColorModifier
### INPUT ###
url = "https://google.com"
name = json[].name
rad url:
    fields name
    name:
        color "dim" "o[a-z]"
### STDERR ###
error[RAD20025]: "dim" is a style attribute, not a color. The color modifier only accepts colors:
  [black blue cyan green magenta orange pink plain red white yellow]
  --> <script>:6:15
  |
5 |     name:
6 |         color "dim" "o[a-z]"
  |               ^^^^^
  |
  = info: rad docs RAD20025
### EXIT ###
1
